If=20you=20have,=20say,=208=20repeated=20counts,=20then=20for=20each=20tra=
nsect=20you=20pool=20the=20data=20for=20
each=20count,=20and=20multiply=20the=20effort=20by=208.=20=20If=20there=20=
are=2030=20transects=20each=20of=20100=20
meters,=20you=20will=20have=2030=20transects=20of=20length=20800m.=20=20=20=

